{"scenario": "work/mirror-traffic-at-30-agents", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "Budget row work-mirror-traffic (design 13), on the hub clock. 30 agents each finish two turns that write 1 MB within one hub second, while an editor is subscribed to the hub's events and a second also to the entries of one session. The first gets at most 30 agent snapshots in that second, no agent-entries, and when the next window opens only the latest state of each session (two turns done); the second gets its session's entries only. No line to either holds rawInput."}
